From 6694e19ff00a1acdd7c0bf1b5784e795ac7c4de2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:48:40 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] flight.xwa_roll: X-Wing Alliance twist roll

The analog roll axis uses XWA's per-craft ModelDef rollRate scaled by XWA's
throttle curve and power steps, and the yaw auto-bank stays on while the twist
is deflected. TIE's fixed 12/127 stick dead zone already exceeds XWA's 8%.
10th TIE_XVT_OPTION; Game page: Twist Roll.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
